subject_definitions:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: a 45-year-old male property manager. Slightly overweight, slicked-back oily hair, round face, an ingratiating smile that flips into a scowl, white shirt buttoned to the closed collar under a dark grey buttoned waistcoat, dark grey trousers, black leather shoes. His voice is loud, nasal and bullying, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 1>.
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: a 25-year-old female cleaner. Preserve her exact face, small lean build, centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, plain dark-navy button-up work shirt buttoned to the closed collar with small plain buttons down the front, a worn grey apron over dark navy trousers, black cloth shoes. Her voice is low, steady and slightly hoarse, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 2>.
<Subject 3> — 小唐: a 22-year-old female cleaning-team colleague. Thin, pale, narrow shoulders, shifty sidelong eyes, hair tied back in a low ponytail, light-grey button-up work shirt with a pointed collar and matching light-grey trousers, a light-grey apron tied round her waist, black cloth shoes. Her voice is small, thin and nervous. It is the person shown in <Picture 3>.
<Picture 4>: the office layout reference for 万山大厦 — this same single room is the set for the whole clip. Light-oak storage cabinets along the back-left wall with plain brown cardboard boxes stacked on top; a low wooden credenza under the back window with a printer, files and two potted green plants; an L-shaped wooden office desk with a black monitor, keyboard and document tray in the middle of the room, a black swivel chair pushed in; a grey fabric sofa with wooden armrests and a low wooden coffee table under the long window on the right; an open doorway with a grey metal frame on the left. Pale grey polished tile floor, white acoustic ceiling with recessed light panels.

summary:
[reference generation] The manager accuses the cleaner of stealing a customer's gold earring and orders her to empty her pockets; she refuses and backs away from the desk; the colleague by the sofa watches without moving.

retention_analysis:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: fully_preserved - slicked-back oily hair, round face, dark grey buttoned waistcoat over a white shirt
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: fully_preserved - centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, dark navy work shirt, worn grey apron
<Subject 3> — 小唐: fully_preserved - hair in a low ponytail, light-grey work shirt, light-grey apron
<Picture 4>: fully_preserved - light-oak cabinets, L-shaped desk, grey sofa on the right, doorway on the left

detailed_description:
HORIZONTAL 4:3 landscape framing, high-key commercial cinematography, soft broad daylight, luminous pale walls, refined natural faces. Keep the film texture, natural lighting, every face, every costume and the realistic motion consistent throughout. People stay standing, framed from the knees up. The camera is locked off for the whole clip: the framing never changes and the size of everything in frame stays the same from the first frame to the last. All movement comes from the people inside the fixed frame.
Exposure: a large window is the key light and soft bounced daylight fills the room; skin tones are bright and even, shadows sit in the light mid-tones, the whites stay white, and the picture carries an even high-key brightness from edge to edge. Every shirt is buttoned to the closed collar, so each chest shows one unbroken run of plain fabric with small plain buttons; apron bibs are plain.
Speaker labels for this shot only: (S1) 钱经理, (S2) 苏小满, (S3) 小唐. Anyone not named here stays silent with a closed mouth.
The whole clip takes place in the one office shown in <Picture 4>, and the three of them hold these same standing places from the first frame to the last: 钱经理 (S1) behind the L-shaped desk in the middle of the room, three-quarters to the camera; 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of that desk in right profile facing right towards him, both feet flat on the tile; 小唐 (S3) on the right side of the room beside the grey sofa in left profile, facing left towards the desk.

[Shot 1] Static Shot, medium two-shot across the desk: 钱经理 (S1) behind the L-shaped desk in front of the light-oak cabinets, one palm flat on the wood and the other hand holding a small folded paper; 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of the desk in right profile facing right towards him, both feet flat on the tile.

[Shot 2] At 00:01.250, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the same frame without any camera movement, 钱经理 (S1)'s hand as it closes over the folded paper and lifts it off the wood; the paper's crease catches the daylight for a moment before his fist hides it. His mouth opens and he speaks in a short flat nasal Mandarin: [Chinese] 这字是你的吧。

[Shot 3] At 00:02.500, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the same frame without any camera movement, 苏小满 (S2) still at the near left corner of the desk in right profile, a plain pale wall behind her; her hand leaves the desk and comes to rest flat against her own waist. She draws one step back from the wood and answers in a low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 你们不能搜我。

[Shot 4] At 00:03.750, Camera: Static Shot, holding a medium two-shot over the desk: 钱经理 (S1) behind the L-shaped desk unfolds the paper flat on the wood and pins it down with two fingers, his shoulders square and his eyes still on 苏小满 (S2); 苏小满 (S2) stands at the near left corner of the desk in right profile facing right, the distance between them across the wood fixed. The camera is locked off and does not move, follow, pan, or track in this beat.

[Shot 5] At 00:05.000, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the same frame without any camera movement on the unfolded paper lying flat on the wood, its printed rows blurred and unreadable at this distance, and 钱经理 (S1)'s thumbnail tapping the top row once from the top of frame. The camera travels in a straight line and stays level, and the desk edge and every cabinet in the background hold a fixed position through this beat.

[Shot 6] At 00:06.500, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the same wide frame without any camera movement to reveal the whole office: 钱经理 (S1) still bearing down across from 苏小满 (S2) with the paper spread before him on the desk, 小唐 (S3) still beside the grey sofa at the right of frame in left profile with her arms wrapped around herself. All three hold their positions.

From [Shot 4] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement in frame is 钱经理 (S1) swallowing; every line of dialogue has already finished, and the office falls into room tone.

No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.

overall_soundscape: A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; a short inhale from 钱经理 at 1.1s before he speaks; the crisp sound of paper unfolding on wood at 4.0s; one nervous swallow from 小唐 at 5.4s; a soft scrape of a shoe on the floor at 6.8s as 苏小满 steps back.

non_diegetic_music: A low sustained string drone begins at 0s, a single muted cello note enters at 1.25s when he starts speaking, and the track thins to a single held note from 5.0s.
